# CTR_DRBG vectors without the derivation function
#
# Most vectors are derived from the NIST ACVP-Server ctrDRBG-SP800-90Ar1
# test data, using the groups without prediction resistance. EntropyInput is
# entropy XOR personalization string, and EntropyInputReseed is the reseed
# entropy XOR reseed additional input.
#
# The remaining vectors cover empty or short inputs and a range of output
# lengths, including ones which are not a multiple of the block size. These
# were computed with an independent Python implementation which was first
# checked against all of the ACVP CTR_DRBG AES vectors.

